      "date": "2026-05-16T19:46:19.000Z",
      "title": "Final dividend of ₹7.00 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹7.00. Ex-date: 29th May 2026 Payment date: 3rd July 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.7%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (24% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (28% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 28% per year over the past 9 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 47% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
